@@ -0,0 +1,12 @@
+issueNumber: MDL-88319
+notes:
+  core:
+    - message: >-
+        A new hook `\core\hook\output\before_help_icon_rendered` is dispatched in
+        `core_renderer::render_help_icon()` before the help icon template is rendered.
+        Callbacks can modify the mutable template context (`text`, `title`, `url`,
+        `completedoclink`, etc.) to change the popover content, add HTML immediately
+        before or after the icon with `add_before_icon()` / `add_after_icon()`, or
+        provide a full replacement with `set_replacement()`, in which case the default
+        template rendering is skipped.
+      type: improved
